  "description": "Change of use from Use Class C3 (dwelling house) to Use Class C4 (HMO-house in multiple occupation) and part single, part 2-storey rear extension, rear dormer involving hip to gable roof extension, with associated amenity, cycle and refuse storage.\r",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed first floor rear extension by virtue of its height, depth and siting in relation to No. 16 Windsor Road, would appear as an unneighbourly form of development that would unduly restrict light, outlook and visual amenity afforded to an adjacent first floor rear facing habitable room window at No. 16 Windsor Road. The proposal would therefore be contrary to Policies D3 and D6 of the London Plan (2021), CP30 of the Core Strategy (2010), Policies DMD8 and DMD11 of the Development Management Document (2014) as well as the aims and intentions outlined within the NPPF (2024)."
  ],
